# Canonical origin, no trailing slash. Every canonical URL, hreflang alternate,
# sitemap entry, OG URL and JSON-LD @id is built from this.
#
# Leave it unset in production: src/lib/site.ts falls back to
# https://saudienergynews.com, so a forgotten variable cannot ship a build full
# of localhost URLs. Set it only to point a build somewhere else — a staging
# host, or local development that needs realistic absolute URLs.
#
# Changing the production origin after the site is indexed means a full
# re-index, so treat it as fixed.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
